      "prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset: clean background plate for an animated children's game cinematic, not a finished still. Edit the attached opening illustration: remove ONLY the little girl and the flying fairy, and all their sparkles/shadows. Reconstruct the empty wooden porch steps, plants, and path naturally behind them. Preserve the wooden house, open door, steps, tree, grass, flowers, white fence, distant hills and lake, composition, perspective, morning lighting, painterly storybook style and fine detail. The place where the girl stood must be unobstructed empty wooden steps and path suitable for independently animated character layers. No people, no fairy, no text, no interface. Same wide composition."
