    {
      "file": "piquenique-sem-yuna-v1.png",
      "prompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset: clean layered background for an animated children's game ending. Edit the supplied picnic illustration: remove ONLY the little girl and tiny golden fairy sitting to her left, including their held bread and their small cup. Reconstruct empty picnic blanket and grass naturally where they sat. KEEP the seated teddy bear with blue bandana, green dinosaur, red robot, toy train, plates of bread, large juice pitcher and cups for the toys, tree, roots, garden, fence and distant landscape exactly coherent with the supplied painting. Keep the same eye-level wide composition, sunny painterly storybook finish. Leave an empty place on the left half of the blanket for girl and fairy layers to be animated separately. No humans or fairies anywhere. No text, interface or labels."
    },
    {
      "file": "atuacao-yuna-nanda-v1.png",
      "prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve. Asset type: transparent cinematic character acting atlas for layered 2D storybook game. References: image 1 defines Yuna's EXACT face, curly brown twin ponytails, pink bows, yellow puff sleeve shirt, turquoise candy-print pinafore and pink-white shoes; image 2 defines her seated tired identity and tiny golden fairy Nanda. Create a clean FOUR COLUMNS by TWO ROWS atlas on genuine transparent background, evenly separated cells, entire figures, no cropping, no scenery, no ground, no captions. Eight cells left to right: top row 1 Yuna standing facing three-quarter right, excited tentative smile, one hand near chest; 2 same girl same size standing shoulders slightly raised, worried expression noticing insect, hands closer to torso; 3 same girl same size cautiously taking a small step right, both shoes visible; 4 same girl seated on blanket-height ground with legs stretched slightly right, exhausted relaxed shoulders, empty hands and small relieved smile. Bottom row 1 SAME seated girl same body position and scale holding a small round bread with right hand at her lap; 2 SAME seated girl same body position bringing bread to mouth, gentle chewing expression, left hand resting by hip; 3 golden fairy Nanda seated with legs bent right and wings resting, holding bread the size of her own hand at her lap and a tiny cup of orange juice in other hand; 4 SAME seated fairy same scale brings bread to mouth and holds cup, happy eating expression. Girls in all six cells have consistent head/body size, seated height naturally shorter than standing. Fairy drawings may fill their cells so details readable, runtime will make her tiny. Preserve exact clothes and identities. Fine detailed warm handpainted children's storybook style, soft natural lighting, clean RGBA alpha around every strand and shoe. No extra arms, fingers, food outside hands, shadows cast onto opaque backgrounds, panels, dividing lines, text or watermark. Transparent background."
